            <div xml:id="m-45257d35-e2d2-44a2-a3f1-7ee98663fa85">
              <lg xml:id="m-f7ad63b4-3310-4282-abcf-60ee56260037">
                <l xml:id="m-ccbb44ed-d5cd-474c-95e6-d281d871b18f" facs="#m-a0690b61-ccd5-424f-9661-b3e5b3ffce15" label="text-like">Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria. 1091</l><l xml:id="m-9375a187-20c6-4186-b282-1997ac82cd69" facs="#m-bd624833-7f99-49f3-a77c-037c2bd373d6" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-bc73be24-1726-4e81-bb7d-96b51b379f81" facs="#m-c10d835c-9586-427b-9d51-8903b80b7bee" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7.</l><l xml:id="m-f166a9a9-6bf2-4ef5-9217-b61cc0c40634" facs="#m-ac526a89-04cf-40bb-829f-c458a18c0084" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-36ff1f68-64bb-40cc-b603-9e20ee4fd361" facs="#m-770ebbcf-f10e-4636-b8ce-8c40a320a3c8" label="lyrics-like">ON ló-tis mánibus “ manducá-re, non co-in¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4371c7d-865c-4099-aad4-be24fbcac583" facs="#m-d81535f9-1ada-4c45-9ec9-5fd3548b48c4" label="lyrics-like">quinat hóminem.</l><l xml:id="m-cdc53f16-7641-4649-8353-4294d2f7cccf" facs="#m-f59792d5-fc7e-4791-81df-18a33e17f35a" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-b8cbca8a-4bf7-476e-95e6-66ec47a3b635" facs="#m-6fe2b365-47ca-4902-ad56-b943d5c17acc" label="lyrics-like">(VOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens! lis ómnibus, secúra tibi mente ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-bfabe254-4d22-4ced-8898-bdae00c39ead" facs="#m-5f4bd163-648b-4ed6-af42-35decc9d6d83" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: ut qui protectiónis tuae ! viámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e29b0054-ea4f-46b0-a59f-abbc13948bf2" facs="#m-54805618-51a7-4fa3-a0e0-46744ddfda5d" label="lyrics-like">grátiam quaérimus, “ liberáti a ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-e81f3395-a37e-43fd-91cb-c0099c65f128" facs="#m-0b574cdc-77f4-4d25-aafe-8e7b8afbfb57" label="ambiguous">Thursday.</l><l xml:id="m-b848cb6f-5958-4bb7-bd69-0fa9ed5d0d81" facs="#m-8c39afc6-033c-45be-96d4-8520ef3b1c26" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-bedccfa7-3a78-46da-8ee6-e37ecb3d0663" facs="#m-70b63483-7446-46e1-be14-0113ef2bb514" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-f0e4bb4a-5057-43ad-b0fb-2721b1e611a0" facs="#m-a223839d-211a-496c-b365-6bb921a3d51b" label="lyrics-like">X-íbant autem“ daemóni-a a múltis clamán¬</l><l xml:id="m-79fa6fb5-5311-475b-a8a3-4184e4aff2bb" facs="#m-6355ebdf-2ce3-41ec-aed5-9fd62efa2910" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-657081aa-5719-4700-abb2-22855a5d310d" facs="#m-b58692ac-766d-43dc-b4e7-170002127710" label="lyrics-like">ti-a, et dicénti-a: Qui-a tu es Fí- li-us Dé¬: et</l><l xml:id="m-1177cd1a-c951-4b85-9ee6-46143bb3c51f" facs="#m-30894496-cf8e-4fe7-b51d-3d4432010526" label="lyrics-like">increpans non sinébat é-a lóqui qui-a sci¬ ébant spsum</l><l xml:id="m-cd086842-6fe9-4ffe-b9c4-1a60f8fb489a" facs="#m-2b0d14c2-f7f2-4831-aa45-e44268f84eef" label="lyrics-like">ésse Chrístum.</l><l xml:id="m-11c56cbd-6fee-4651-8dbf-5b5aea5e2f59" facs="#m-bd941ca3-ab14-410e-a2d5-752ccc9c31b9" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-1ce50ef7-faee-41b4-b168-1b6be8380493" facs="#m-3558b033-9f8f-4901-bec0-b767ad04dc94" label="lyrics-like">Agníficet te Dómine sanctó-] illis glóriam sempitérnam, *et</l><l xml:id="m-d85ba826-5884-4526-8d4e-31fcfa8ee9b9" facs="#m-c090e3d8-d87d-4f94-87fa-6cb1b41b188c" label="lyrics-like">J1 rum tuórum Cosmae et Da-l opem nobis ineffábili providéntia</l><l xml:id="m-26abd175-4704-434f-a9ff-31e4d00d7618" facs="#m-99eebfed-ab5e-4f43-b5ad-cb72a3a723af" label="lyrics-like">miáni beáta solémnitas: t qua et contulisti. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-51e52801-47cd-4045-8f06-29c995f6f110" facs="#m-c0832746-f3fc-49e8-81df-933e3a9000cd" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-e17f7701-9365-4dc7-8d10-d7f2c4079e15" facs="#m-6351370e-af18-421d-a051-46d6cd5f061b" label="ambiguous">Ant.1.</l><l xml:id="m-960f0681-b878-4161-9998-240e1678cb36" facs="#m-ed461874-4d9e-4e3a-85b3-fcea686b2933" label="ambiguous">9</l><l xml:id="m-4b96533a-3122-4989-a5d5-f9d103d5c2d9" facs="#m-9f176fcd-8ea6-431e-8e5a-d8dea520e0a0" label="lyrics-like">-mnes" qui habébant infírmos, du-cébant illos</l><l xml:id="m-aa48f8ab-dfe4-4bba-b923-65401ab11e21" facs="#m-06f4d8b3-3e96-492b-9544-a4c623acc58c" label="lyrics-like">ad Jésum, et sanabán-tur.</l><l xml:id="m-bcbf9517-a485-451b-a8ef-c403527e6182" facs="#m-e94fda8d-0c30-4874-994f-f786ec26702a" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-87bcab15-5dbe-4f5b-9f96-c6e9e199cd16" facs="#m-8cd4e432-b51c-4c35-91d8-302dd92e6786" label="lyrics-like">NUbjéctum tibi pópulum, quaé- léstis amplíficet: “ et tuis semper</l><l xml:id="m-cbcbd040-21d8-4ccb-a700-0d17dcded262" facs="#m-8d31197e-b251-43b9-b23e-042281be9dc7" label="lyrics-like">O sumus Dómine, propitiátio cae¬ fáciat servire mandátis. Per Dñum.</l><l xml:id="m-d2d14d6f-1efb-4f8d-9e57-b9c4ba794b88" facs="#m-0a376cd7-0158-459f-afd7-6a740e4ae109" label="ambiguous">Nesoi-4</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
